  "body": "Information Pack: https://vltre.co/5raSvf\r\n\r\nA Modern Home Designed Around the Way You Live.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Lot 3 at 14 Kiri Place, Mairangi Bay - an exciting opportunity to secure a beautifully designed brand-new home in a sought-after North Shore location.\r\n\r\nCombining contemporary architecture, functional spaces and stylish finishes, this residence offers the perfect balance between everyday comfort and modern sophistication.\r\n\r\nWhether you're raising a family, upgrading your lifestyle or looking for a quality investment, this home offers plenty to appreciate.\r\n\r\nA Layout That Makes Sense\r\n\r\n*  Four generously proportioned bedrooms\r\n*  Two stylish, fully tiled bathrooms\r\n*  Additional guest toilet downstairs\r\n*  Internal-access garage\r\n*  Designer kitchen with premium appliances and elegant stone benchtops\r\n*  Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n*  Outdoor decking, ideal for entertaining or unwinding\r\n\r\nThoughtful Features. Modern Comfort.\r\n\r\n*  Freehold title - no body corporate fees\r\n*  Underfloor heating for added comfort\r\n*  Designer bathrooms with contemporary finishes\r\n*  Feature lighting\r\n*  Air conditioning in the living area and master bedroom\r\n*  Contemporary interiors and natural light\r\n\r\nA School Zone Worth Considering\r\n\r\nPositioned within the highly sought-after Rangitoto College zone, this property offers an attractive proposition for families looking to secure a modern home in a desirable education zone.\r\n\r\nEverything Within Easy Reach\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of nearby shopping centres, cafés, restaurants, motorway connections via Constellation Drive and some of Auckland's beautiful North Shore beaches.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms. Beautifully considered spaces. A lifestyle worth upgrading to.\r\n\r\nMake Lot 3 at 14 Kiri Place your next move!\r\n\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: Specified floor and land area sizes have been obtained from sources such as Property Guru, Auckland Council (LIM) or Title documents. They have not been measured by the Salesperson or The WORX Real Estate / Real Estate Brokers Limited. We recommend you seek your own independent legal advice if these sizes are material to your purchasing decision.",
